          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বীর — bīr — \"a hero; a warrior\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সেই যুদ্ধের বীরদের গল্প সবাই জানে। sei juddher bīrder gôlpo sôbāi jāne. Everyone knows the stories of the heroes of that war."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বীর (bīr) is Sanskrit vīra, 'a man; a hero, a chief' (Monier-Williams); the ী is long in writing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
